{"segs": ["PA_ja_12:0.4"], "en": "2. The Nigrodha Deer Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_12:1.1"], "en": "“One should resort only to the banyan tree;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
